- not stated (card): ALMA CASA/pipeline version and tclean parameters (cell, image size, masking, continuum subtraction); Disk gas surface density profile and temperature/aspect ratio profile of initial condition; DALI stellar spectrum, luminosity, CO abundance, grain properties, inclination, PA; How model images were convolved/compared quantitatively to ALMA data; Simulation code availability

